    <briefdescription>
<para>Gather data sent from pelist onto the root pe Wrapper for MPI_gather, can be used with and without indices. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>sbuf</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>MPP_TYPE_ data buffer to send </para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>rbuf</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>MPP_TYPE_ data buffer to receive </para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>pelist</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>integer(:) optional pelist to gather from, defaults to current</para></parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<linebreak/>
 Example usage: <verbatim>               call mpp_gather(send_buffer,recv_buffer, pelist)
               call mpp_gather(is, ie, js, je, pelist, array_seg, data, is_root_pe)</verbatim> </para>    </detaileddescription>
